---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Two-state HMM drawn as a diagram. Numbers: the fitted S&P 500 model (python EM, 2016-12 to 2026-11).
// Transition matrix rows: calm 0.982/0.018, turbulent 0.046/0.954. Expected stay = 1/(1-p_stay): 56 and 22 days.
const W = 900, H = 450;
---
<figure class="p5s">
  <div class="p5s-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="A two-state diagram. The calm state stays calm with probability 98.2 percent and moves to turbulent with 1.8 percent. The turbulent state stays turbulent with 95.4 percent and moves to calm with 4.6 percent. Each state emits daily returns with its own spread. A strip of daily returns below shows that only the returns are observed.">
        <text x="20" y="26" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>A hidden state, a visible return</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Trạng thái ẩn, lợi suất nhìn thấy</tspan>
    </text>

    <g transform="translate(0,22)">
    <rect x="90" y="80" width="250" height="130" rx="10" class="st calm" />
    <DiagramIcon name="ok" x="122" y="112" size="24" />
    <text x="148" y="118" class="sn">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Calm</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Yên</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="110" y="150" class="sd">
      <tspan data-lang-en>returns spread ±0.64% a day</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>lợi suất dao động ±0,64% mỗi ngày</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="110" y="176" class="sd">
      <tspan data-lang-en>stays about 56 days</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>kéo dài trung bình khoảng 56 ngày</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="560" y="80" width="250" height="130" rx="10" class="st turb" />
    <DiagramIcon name="warning" x="592" y="112" size="24" />
    <text x="618" y="118" class="sn">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Turbulent</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Hỗn loạn</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="580" y="150" class="sd">
      <tspan data-lang-en>returns spread ±1.93% a day</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>lợi suất dao động ±1,93% mỗi ngày</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="580" y="176" class="sd">
      <tspan data-lang-en>stays about 22 days</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>kéo dài trung bình khoảng 22 ngày</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* self loops */}
    <path d="M 150 80 C 130 40, 300 40, 280 80" class="arr" />
    <polygon points="280,80 272,69 287,70" class="head" />
    <text x="215" y="46" text-anchor="middle" class="pr">
      <tspan data-lang-en>stay: 98.2%</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>ở lại: 98,2%</tspan>
    </text>
    <path d="M 620 80 C 600 40, 770 40, 750 80" class="arr" />
    <polygon points="750,80 742,69 757,70" class="head" />
    <text x="685" y="46" text-anchor="middle" class="pr">
      <tspan data-lang-en>stay: 95.4%</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>ở lại: 95,4%</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* cross arrows */}
    <line x1="342" y1="125" x2="548" y2="125" class="arr" />
    <polygon points="558,125 546,119 546,131" class="head" />
    <text x="450" y="116" text-anchor="middle" class="pr">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1.8% a day</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1,8% mỗi ngày</tspan>
    </text>
    <line x1="558" y1="170" x2="352" y2="170" class="arr" />
    <polygon points="342,170 354,164 354,176" class="head" />
    <text x="450" y="192" text-anchor="middle" class="pr">
      <tspan data-lang-en>4.6% a day</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>4,6% mỗi ngày</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* hidden / visible */}
    <line x1="60" y1="244" x2="840" y2="244" class="veil" />
    <text x="60" y="266" class="note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Above the line: hidden, you never see it. Below: what the market prints.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Phía trên: ẩn, bạn không bao giờ thấy. Phía dưới: những gì thị trường in ra.</tspan>
    </text>
    {[-0.2, 0.2, -0.3, 0.5, -0.4, -1.1, -3.4, -3.1, -0.4, -4.5, -0.8, 4.5, -2.9, 4.1].map((v, k) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={80 + k * 54} y={v >= 0 ? 340 - v * 8 : 340} width="28" height={Math.abs(v) * 8 + 1.5} rx="2" class={Math.abs(v) > 2 ? 'rb hot' : 'rb'} />
      </g>
    ))}
    <line x1="60" y1="340" x2="840" y2="340" class="axis" />
    <text x="60" y="394" class="note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Daily returns (%) of the S&amp;P 500, 13 Feb to 4 Mar 2020: calm days, then the state switches.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Lợi suất ngày (%) của S&amp;P 500, 13/2 tới 4/3/2020: những ngày yên, rồi trạng thái đổi.</tspan>
    </text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The matrix says states are sticky: calm stays calm 98.2% of days. The model never sees the state, only the returns, and works backwards from how large they are.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Ma trận cho thấy trạng thái bám dai: yên thì 98,2% số ngày vẫn yên. Mô hình không bao giờ thấy trạng thái, chỉ thấy lợi suất, rồi suy ngược từ độ lớn của chúng.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p5s { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p5s-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p5s svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .p5s text { fill: var(--text-body); font-size: 13px; }
  .p5s .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p5s .sn { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p5s .sd { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p5s .pr { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p5s .note { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .p5s .st { stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .p5s .st.calm { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .p5s .st.turb { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .p5s .arr { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .p5s .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p5s .veil { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 5; }
  .p5s .axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .p5s .rb { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.1; }
  .p5s .rb.hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .p5s figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
